{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22904","headline":"酬元员外三月三十日慈恩寺相忆见寄 · 白居易","name":"酬元员外三月三十日慈恩寺相忆见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怅望慈恩三月尽，紫桐花落鸟关关。\n诚知曲水春相忆，其奈长沙老未还。\n赤岭猨声催白首，黄茅瘴色换朱颜。\n谁言南国无霜雪，尽在愁人鬓发间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}